Hi,

Anything that helps learning Lojban is welcome. This is useful in my=20
opinion. I think missing translations should be blank, so that it is easier=
=20
to focus attention on them.=20

Another issue is what to do for controlling the quality of translations? It=
=20
would not be enough if someone checks/approves them, since they could be=20
latter changed again. Once this grows substantially and there are many=20
users, we will face the issue of quality control. We need a way to lock=20
phrases once we know they are ok.

Best Regards,

=C1lvaro



